Subject: META: No More Prefixes!

Timothy C. May writes:
> Somehow I doubt Ray is saving much time by, for example, deleting all
> "ECON:" postings. Only a fraction of all messages use any one prefix,
> anyway, so the savings is in proportion to the percentage using that
> prefix. And of course it takes some nonzero time to respond to determine
